  "description": "An Avro IDL compiler, C# code generator and schema toolkit as a .NET tool. Compiles Avro IDL to protocols and schemas, generates readable C# for them, checks two schemas for compatibility under Avro's schema-evolution rules, prints a semantic diff between schema versions, prints the Parsing Canonical Form and fingerprints of a schema, and inspects Avro object container files.",
